summary:
  A Bluetooth speaker that the verify's sweep finds deaf is shelved without
  being offered the SBC-XQ seat.

history:
  The periodic sweep shelves a deaf Bluetooth speaker, offers it the seat
  once and stamps the offer — and the stamp is what earns it one later look.
  The verify's sweep shelved the same speaker and did neither, so it stayed
  shelved for the life of the group. The offer became one function on
  2026-09-21 and both roads call it; this takes the verify's call away again.

target:
  package/contents/ui/SyncEngine.qml

find:
                      // offered the seat and never stamped for its later look.
                      _hearingOffer();

replace:
                      // offered the seat and never stamped for its later look.
                      void 0;

expect:
  Killed by tst_syncengine::test_a_speaker_shelved_by_the_verify_gets_the_same_offer_as_one_shelved_by_the_sweep.
  Line-neutral.
